        "created_at": "2020-02-07T07:46:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In the starter kit you could do an Overcome action to stop the scene tracker from advancing during the next environment turn where is that rule in the preveiws?</p>\n<p>I could not find it in chapter 2 or 4. of course i am not at my best trying to read PDFs on the laptop or reading anything after work.</p>\n<p>Villains can Overcome to advance the scene tracker so heroes should still have the mirror option</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:30.274Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
