        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>In the starter kit you could do an Overcome action to stop the scene tracker from advancing during the next environment turn where is that rule in the preveiws?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I could not find it in chapter 2 or 4. of course i am not at my best trying to read PDFs on the laptop or reading anything after work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Villains can Overcome to advance the scene tracker so heroes should still have the mirror option</p>",
